{"id": "doc-003", "type": "selected_text", "content": "allow-jit + allow-unsigned-executable-memory — required because mlx and the gguf (llama.cpp) backends do runtime codegen / load JIT-compiled kernels. Without these, the hardened runtime kills the process on first inference.\n\ndisable-library-validation — required because the bundle drops mlx.metallib into Contents/MacOS/ after build and may load other unsigned libs from the same dir.\n\nThese entitlements are accepted by Apple notarization for direct-distribution apps; they would not be accepted on the Mac App Store.", "user_note": "이 세 줄 없으면 서명한 빌드에서 첫 추론에 프로세스가 그냥 죽는다. 스토어 포기 근거 2", "application": "Safari", "window_title": "macos-notarization.md", "url": "https://github.com/pwittchen/aictl/blob/master/.claude/plans/done/macos-notarization.md", "captured_at": "2026-08-25T17:01:00+09:00", "summary": null, "topics": []}
{"id": "doc-004", "type": "selected_text", "content": "In macOS Sequoia, users will no longer be able to Control-click to override Gatekeeper when opening software that isn't signed correctly or notarized. They'll need to visit System Settings > Privacy & Security to review security information for software before allowing it to run.\n\nIf you distribute software outside of the Mac App Store, we recommend that you submit your software to be notarized.", "user_note": "우클릭 우회가 사라졌다. 이 절차를 거치게 하면 유료 앱 첫인상이 망한다", "application": "Safari", "window_title": "Updates to runtime protection in macOS Sequoia - Apple Developer", "url": "https://developer.apple.com/news/?id=saqachfa", "captured_at": "2026-08-25T17:03:00+09:00", "summary": null, "topics": []}
{"id": "doc-005", "type": "selected_text", "content": "Language | SenseVoice-Small | Whisper-Large-V3 | Winner\nChinese (zh-CN) | 10.78% CER | 12.55% CER | SenseVoice\nCantonese (yue) | 7.09% CER | 10.41% CER | SenseVoice\nJapanese (ja) | 11.96% CER | 10.34% CER | Whisper\nKorean (ko) | 8.28% CER | 5.59% CER | Whisper\nEnglish (en) | 14.71% WER | 9.39% WER | Whisper\n\nParakeet does not cover these languages at all.", "user_note": "말소리 옮겨적는 모델 비교. 우리말은 Whisper가 더 정확하니 속도 포기하고 정확도 택함", "application": "Safari", "window_title": "SenseVoice vs Whisper: Best Model for Japanese, Korean & Chinese", "url": "https://whispernotes.app/blog/sensevoice-fastest-cjk-transcription", "captured_at": "2026-08-25T16:53:00+09:00", "summary": null, "topics": []}
