{"id": "doc-007", "type": "selected_text", "content": "As far as DTS is aware updating your app's ML models after installation isn't in conflict with App Store guidelines. There are existing apps that depend on this behavior.\n\nGuideline 2.5.2: Apps should be self-contained in their bundles, and may not download, install, or execute code which introduces or changes features or functionality of the app.", "user_note": "학습된 파일을 나중에 받아오는 건 걸리지 않는다. 코드가 아니라 자료로 본다", "application": "Safari", "window_title": "Is it allowed for an iOS app to download ML models | Apple Developer Forums", "url": "https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/793131", "captured_at": "2026-08-25T17:02:00+09:00", "summary": null, "topics": []}
{"id": "doc-008", "type": "note", "content": "방금 민수님과 이야기했는데 목요일까지 API 명세를 전달하기로 했다. 인증 부분은 우리가 먼저 초안 잡고 리뷰 요청하는 걸로 정리됨. 응답 스키마는 기존 v1 형태 유지.", "user_note": null, "application": null, "window_title": null, "url": null, "captured_at": "2026-08-24T14:20:00+09:00", "summary": null, "topics": []}
{"id": "doc-009", "type": "screenshot", "content": null, "ocr_text": "Rerankers are the highest-impact quality upgrade avaiIable to any RAG\nsystem, and the 2026 open-weight lineup delivers frontier precision\nentireIy on local hardware.\n\nAlways rerank the top-k: Retrieve 50-100 candidates with embeddings,\nrerank to top 5-10 — never rerank the entire corpus.\n\nPair with hybrid retrievaI: BGE-M3 or Qwen3-Embedding recall + a\nreranker's precision is the 2026 gold standard.\n\nWatch pair ordering: Most cross-encoders are asymmetric — put the\nquery first.", "user_note": "찾아온 걸 다시 줄 세우는 단계를 넣으면 품질이 확 오른다는 글", "application": "Google Chrome", "window_title": "Top Reranker AI Models 2026: Precision Retrieval", "url": "https://local-ai-zone.github.io/guides/best-ai-reranker-models-ultimate-ranking-2026.html", "captured_at": "2026-08-25T16:53:00+09:00", "summary": null, "topics": []}
